---------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. FREE USE (Local Personal Use Only)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

You may use this Software free of charge if ALL of the following conditions
are met:

  (a) You use the Software solely for personal purposes on your local machine.
  (b) You do NOT expose the Software to others via any IP address or domain name.
  (c) You do NOT establish federation connections with any other world.
  (d) You do NOT engage in secondary development for external sale.

If any of the above conditions is NOT met, you MUST obtain a Subscription
License as described in Section 2 below.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. SUBSCRIPTION LICENSE (Required for Networked / Federation / Commercial Use)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

A Subscription License is REQUIRED if you do ANY of the following:

  (a) Make the Software accessible to others via an IP address or domain name.
  (b) Establish federation connections with other worlds.
  (c) Engage in secondary development and sell the modified Software to others.

By doing so, you acknowledge that the Software is delivering networked value,
and you agree to subscribe to support continued development.

2.1 First-Time Subscription
  - Fee: CNY ¥60 (or USD $9.18)
  - Includes: 2 months free after first payment, then ¥3 per month thereafter

2.2 Monthly Renewal (per world)
  - Fee: CNY ¥3 per month
  - Equivalent: CNY ¥36 per year | ¥360 per 10 years | ¥3,600 per 100 years

2.3 Lapse and Re-subscription

  Lapse Duration         | Re-subscription Fee
  -----------------------|------------------------------------
  Up to 12 months        | CNY ¥3 per lapsed month (linear)
  More than 12 months    | CNY ¥60 (flat, regardless of how
    (no matter how long) |   long the lapse lasted)

  Example: If your subscription lapsed for 3 months, you pay ¥9 to
  re-subscribe. If it lapsed for 15 months or 5 years, you pay ¥60.

2.4 Version Download Rights

  - During an active subscription: You may download and install the latest
    version of the Software at any time.
  - After your subscription lapses: You may NOT download any new versions.
    The version you have already installed may continue to run.
  - To regain download access to new versions, you must re-subscribe
    according to Section 2.3.

2.5 Secondary Development for Sale

  If you modify the Software and sell it to others, you MUST:
  (a) Maintain an active Subscription License (same fee structure as above).
  (b) Contact the Licensor to obtain written authorization.
  (c) Provide appropriate attribution / feedback to the original author.

